rs/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T19:07:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T19:09:45Z","body":"Is there a reason there is no change check in `Window::set_flag` or `DisplayServer::window_set_flag`?\r\nUsers have access to these flags too.\r\nCould other flags cause similar issues?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5346779404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5347955708","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122591#issuecomment-5347955708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122591","id":5347955708,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPsNT_A","user":{"login":"Prawnya","id":170275512,"node_id":"U_kgDOCiYyuA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170275512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya","html_url":"https://github.com/Prawnya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-19T21:02:06Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T21:10:17Z","body":"> Could other flags cause similar issues?\r\n\r\nAny flag that results in `DisplayServerWindows::_update_window_style` being called would cause this as far as I can tell (unsure about other OSs). Though none of the other ones are set by `PopupMenu` after initialization.\r\n\r\n>Is there a reason there is no change check in `Window::set_flag` or `DisplayServer::window_set_flag`?\r\n\r\nNo idea. I considered adding the check in `Window::set_flag`, but was unsure if it would have any side effects. If there are no objections it might be better to move the check there (or `DisplayServerWindows::window_set_flag` as it's only really needed for the flags where `_update_window_style` is called).\r\n\r\n> Users have access to these flags too.\r\n\r\nFrom some limited testing I am unable to reproduce this behavior when running a project or in a `@tool` script. It might be editor specific.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5347955708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359077764","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122591#issuecomment-5359077764","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122591","id":5359077764,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABP20JhA","user":{"login":"Prawnya","id":170275512,"node_id":"U_kgDOCiYyuA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170275512?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya","html_url":"https://github.com/Prawnya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Prawnya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-20T16:57:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-20T16:57:34Z","body":"After taking another look I don't believe having a check in Window::set_flag would cause any problems, and it is a better solution. I will close this and open another pull request with that instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5359077764/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]